<title>UK: SBC sets call, put warrants on HSI.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call, put warrants on HSI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation has issued a total of nine million American-style call and put warrrants in nine equal tranches on the Hang Seng Index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>The warrrants mature on June 10. 1998 and the paydate is June 24, 1997.</p>
<p>They are available in minimum exercise lots of 100.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
